# 💰 Inquis – Personal Finance Analytics Platform

Inquis is a personal finance analytics application built with Python, Streamlit, SQLite, Pandas, and Plotly.

Originally created as a simple expense tracking project during my first year of college, it was later revisited and redesigned into a full analytics-focused application featuring budgeting tools, spending insights, KPI dashboards, and interactive visualizations.

The project serves as both a personal finance management tool and a demonstration of data handling, analytics, dashboard development, and full-cycle project iteration.

---

## 🚀 Features

### Expense Management

* Add and track expenses
* Attach notes to transactions
* Backdate expenses for historical record keeping
* Delete individual transactions
* Clear all transactions with confirmation safeguards

### Budget Management

* Set monthly spending budgets
* Track remaining budget in real time
* Monitor budget utilization percentage

### Analytics Dashboard

* Total spending overview
* Budget tracking metrics
* Remaining budget calculations
* Top spending category identification
* Financial Health Score

### Smart Insights

* Spending pattern summaries
* Budget utilization insights
* Category contribution analysis

### Data Visualization

* Interactive spending distribution pie chart
* Category-wise spending analysis
* Daily spending trend visualization

