## 📖 Project Background

This project began as a small expense tracking application developed during my first year of college. After revisiting the original codebase, I decided to rebuild and expand it using more modern tools and design principles.

The redevelopment process focused on improving usability, analytics capabilities, data visualization, and overall user experience. AI-assisted development tools were used during portions of the refactoring and interface design process.

